              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says to his people, “When you became slaves, no money was paid for you; in the same way nothing will be paid to set you free. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When you went to live in Egypt as foreigners, you did so of your own free will; Assyria, however, took you away by force and paid nothing for you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 2.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now in Babylonia the same thing has happened: you are captives, and nothing was paid for you. Those who rule over you boast and brag and constantly show contempt for me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In time to come you will acknowledge that I am God and that I have spoken to you.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
